## Metadata Limits

| Field | Requirement |
| ----- | ----------- |
| CPUs | 2 or 4 |
| Memory | 2048–16384 MB |
| Storage | 5120–10240 MB |
| GPUs | 0 |
| Build timeout | ≤1800 seconds |
| Agent timeout | ≤3600 seconds |
| Verifier timeout | ≤1800 seconds |
| `network_mode` | Remove |
| `allowed_hosts` | Remove |
| Source | Correct PR, commit, or issue |
| Category | Match task content |
| Difficulty explanation | Explain real technical difficulty |

Check all fields; verdict/fixability follow current Ultra guidelines (not the old “only four fields invalidate” rule).

