## Allowed-Edit Matrix

| Component | May edit? | Conditions |
| --------- | --------- | ---------- |
| `instruction.md` | Yes | Preserve PR scope |
| `problem_statement.md` | Yes | Exact copy of final instruction |
| `tests.patch` | Yes | Add f2p tests only |
| Existing repo tests | No | Must remain unchanged |
| `test.sh` | Yes | Correct test and reward execution |
| `config.json` | Yes | Correct test IDs and commands |
| `grade.py` | Yes | Correct grading behavior |
| `solve.sh` | Yes | Correct oracle |
| `golden.patch` | Yes | Match instruction and source |
| Dockerfile | Limited | Only allowed environment fixes |
| Git metadata | Yes | Hygiene only |
| Tracked repo source | No | Never directly alter starting code |

You may **expand** PR scope for difficulty; never reduce or replace it. Update instruction + tests + oracle together when expanding.

