## Environment Reference

### Usually Fixable

- Missing Bash on Alpine
- Missing tmux
- Missing asciinema
- Missing frozen requirements
- Concrete image tag correction (`:latest` → pin)
- Shebang or executable-bit problem
- CRLF
- Resource-limit adjustment
- Stray build-preparation artifacts
- Most Git hygiene failures

### Potentially Not Fixable

- Tangled toolchain
- Unrecoverable dependency conflict
- Required live service
- Large external model pull
- Unrecoverable Git repository
- Task validity requiring replacement of the source PR scope

Evaluate borderline build issues individually (small missing package/flag may still be Fixable). Dockerfile must build **offline**.

